                "word": "dwarfism",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a00b333f-bb7f-4b68-928d-6a66414d3b2f",
                        "entry_id": "9598e794-39b1-36bd-a836-55ff4ccb833a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "dwarfisms"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "208cae06-a663-3b4d-a6ed-351f7ff15dcf",
                        "entry_id": "9598e794-39b1-36bd-a836-55ff4ccb833a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The condition of being a dwarf (person of short stature)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba989887-ca68-497e-944b-dacf0dc48d64",
                                "sense_id": "208cae06-a663-3b4d-a6ed-351f7ff15dcf",
                                "text": "Studies of disproportionate dwarfisms in animals have revealed the importance of core proteins an sulfation in the development of cartilage."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "81f7800b-5ce3-3451-914e-b833301638cc",
                        "entry_id": "9598e794-39b1-36bd-a836-55ff4ccb833a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The quality of being puny or inferior."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bed249b-153d-4788-a0b2-723b520fedaa",
                                "sense_id": "81f7800b-5ce3-3451-914e-b833301638cc",
                                "text": "Childish, childish to the core: that's why they're so good at nursing, they're arrested in a state of permanent intellectual dwarfism themselves!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2c4645b0-56e4-40ba-912a-07925171657d",
                        "source_entry_id": "9598e794-39b1-36bd-a836-55ff4ccb833a",
                        "source_sense_description": "condition of being a dwarf",
                        "target_lang_word": "nanisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nanisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a769d8c9-3958-31f4-b903-6e62cf14f526",
                                        "entry_id": "683fce15-15c1-360e-983d-c89c1faf36f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Insuffisance de croissance conférant à celui ou celle qui en est atteint(e) une taille limitée à l’âge adulte."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Handicap"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16da816c-ff96-44a0-8890-ed9a5ea5f3ae",
                                                "sense_id": "a769d8c9-3958-31f4-b903-6e62cf14f526",
                                                "text": "Elle vit dans une sorte d’îlot frappé de nanisme. Et lorsqu’elle finit par découvrir ce qui l’entoure – les gens normaux, en somme – elle les traite de monstres."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01e8a3eb-e404-4510-a883-f54008c7476b",
                                                "sense_id": "a769d8c9-3958-31f4-b903-6e62cf14f526",
                                                "text": "Michelangelo Vitaliani, dit Mimo, le protagoniste du roman de Jean-Baptiste Andrea Veiller sur elle, est atteint de nanisme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f62148b0-8243-4019-8e1d-a92f705bb78a",
                                                "sense_id": "a769d8c9-3958-31f4-b903-6e62cf14f526",
                                                "text": "De plus, ces populations montagnardes n’avaient pas accès au sel de mer en raison de son prix, et les cas de difformité et de nanisme étaient fréquents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "06c90180-1ede-44a0-9e23-0f97a5503036",
                        "source_entry_id": "9598e794-39b1-36bd-a836-55ff4ccb833a",
